# ---- deploy hygiene: stray / experimental weights are never pushed ----
# Root strays (auto-downloads, experiments). Deployment RDD lives ONLY at
# backend/app/weights/rdd_india.onnx (tracked) and is copied to
# dashboard/public/weights/rdd_web.onnx at vite dev/build time.
/yolov8n.pt
/yolov8m.pt
/*.pt
/*.onnx
/weights/
# NOTE: no bare `weights/` here — backend/app/weights/rdd_india.onnx is the
# tracked deploy artifact, dashboard/public/weights/*.onnx stays ignored above.
# ---- local-only: never needed to run or deploy the project ----
opencode.json
client-audit/
storage/backups/
# Keep the deployment ONNX + docs tracked even though they sit under weights/.
!backend/app/weights/rdd_india.onnx
!backend/app/weights/README.md
!backend/app/weights/.gitkeep

